WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.936
-Welcome to "Late Night."
How's everybody doing?

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.470
I just spent 12 hours
explaining to my parents

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:08.074
how to download Peacock,
so, yeah, I've been better.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:11.044
President Trump posted a photo
yesterday of himself

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.613
and several Goya products
in the Oval Office.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:17.583
Okay, but why are they
in their original packaging?

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.852
Are you trying to keep them
in mint condition?

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:23.122
They're kidney beans,
not a rocket-firing Boba Fett.

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:26.326
And look, I know he's trying to
encourage people to buy Goya,

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:27.827
but it looks like more like
one of those photos

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:31.531
where DEA agents pose with kilos
of cocaine they just seized.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.832
Or who knows?

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:35.635
Maybe it's a local production of
"Glengarry Glen Ross."

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:38.204
"Second prize --
a week's supply of Goya.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.506
Third prize is you're fired."

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:43.510
Looks like an episode of
racist "Iron Chef."

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:47.680
"Today's secret ingredient is:
Goya beans."

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:52.918
"I guess I could
make, uh, beans."

00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:55.688
President Trump announced
yesterday that he has demoted

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:58.424
campaign manager Brad Parscale
and replaced him

00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:00.026
with his deputy
campaign manager.

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.394
Though that one's on you, Trump.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:04.497
You really thought he was going
to make you look good

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.465
when he made himself
look like that?

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:08.201
He looks like
a Civil War soldier

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:10.736
who was sent home
because of weak blood.

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:13.039
Infectious disease expert
Anthony Fauci said

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:15.708
in an interview yesterday that
despite the White House's effort

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.711
to discredit him, he has not
thought about resigning,

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.646
which is too bad
'cause there's another doctor

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:22.147
that is just
waiting for a chance.

00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:25.051
"I don't know, man.
Have you -- Have you considered

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.585
putting on some 'Rick and Morty'

00:01:26.585 --> 00:01:28.254
and just letting the virus
do its thing?

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.222
I'm a Rick guy. I'll admit it.

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:32.124
Rick gets me."

00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:34.527
Hackers yesterday hijacked
the Twitter accounts

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:35.961
of several public figures,

00:01:35.961 --> 00:01:37.730
including former
President Obama,

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.401
rapper Kanye West, and Microsoft
co-founder Bill Gates

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:43.302
as part of
a cryptocurrency scam.

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:46.071
Said Kanye,
"No, mine was actually me."

00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:49.175
Rapper Kanye West's political
adviser said in a new interview

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:51.511
that West is no longer
trying to run for president.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:53.146
As for what he's going to do
instead,

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:56.382
his political adviser
said to ask again later.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:02:00.787
In a new interview, infectious
disease expert Dr. Anthony Fauci

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:02.755
said that he gets
700 e-mails a day.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:05.758
Apparently, he once ordered
something from Crate &amp; Barrel.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:06.926
"And that's on me.

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:08.794
That was a --
I shouldn't have done that.

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:10.996
I'll take the full blame
for that."

00:02:10.996 --> 00:02:14.033
A coronavirus vaccine
developed by a lab in the U.S.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.136
is entering its final stage of
testing trials later this month.

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:19.472
And officials are hopeful
they could be botching

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.974
the rollout as early as January.

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:24.544
Music streaming service Spotify
announced today

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:27.680
that the Michelle Obama podcast
will debut later this month.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.049
And as soon as
the transcriptions are ready,

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.886
so will the Melania Trump
podcast.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:35.421
Authorities in Delaware are
investigating a recent robbery

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:38.157
at a local pizza shop
where the owner threw a pizza

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:39.959
at the robber in self-defense.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:43.896
Added the delivery guy,
"So, yeah, that's, uh...

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:45.831
That's why it looks like that."

00:02:45.831 --> 00:02:48.167
And finally,
according to a new report,

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.335
men should limit
their alcohol consumption

00:02:50.335 --> 00:02:51.704
to one beverage a day.

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:54.707
So now I have
the other five at night.

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:57.443
That was the monologue.
Hope you enjoyed it.

